WEBVTT

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:30.855
Nilienda kwenye kituo kingine cha matibabu
ambacho kilielewa machukizo yangu,

00:04:30.879 --> 00:04:34.560
taabu yangu, na hofu yangu ya kijamii.

00:04:34.584 --> 00:04:37.900
na walifahamu namna ya kunitibu,
na nilipata msaada niliouhitaji.

00:04:38.202 --> 00:04:40.774
Na baada ya miezi 18 ya kazi ngumu,

00:04:40.798 --> 00:04:43.890
Nikaenda kufanya mambo ya ajabu.

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:48.138
Kitu kimojawapo kuhusu Aspegaz
ni kwamba mara kwa mara,

00:04:48.162 --> 00:04:50.255
hawa watu huwa wana
utu wa ndani mtata sana,

00:04:50.279 --> 00:04:53.120
na mimi ninajifahamu,
nina haiba ya kuvutia sana,

00:04:53.144 --> 00:04:56.848
maoni mazuri, na vitu vingi
vinavyoendelea kwenye akili yangu.


00:04:56.872 --> 00:05:00.245
Lakini kuna mwanya kati
ya mahali hilo linasimama,